### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/

### GET sales data for a valid report date
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales?report_date=2026-06-29

### GET error: missing report_date
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales

### GET error: invalid date format
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales?report_date=29-06-2026

### GET error: date not found
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales?report_date=2026-07-10

### POST new sales record
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "report_date": "2026-07-01",
  "total_units_sold": 1550,
  "total_revenue": 1015000,
  "top_country": "Japan",
  "activation_success_rate": 94.2,
  "units_trend": "+11% vs previous day",
  "revenue_trend": "Crossed 10 lakh revenue",
  "activation_status": "Excellent operations",
  "trend_type": "positive",
  "insight": "Japan became the top-performing market with strong sales and excellent activation success."
}

### GET the record added by POST
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales?report_date=2026-07-01
